      "id": "runs-sent-code",
      "label": "Its AI agent can run commands on your computer; it asks only for ones that look destructive",
      "concern": "high",
      "detail": "In agent mode the AI can run shell commands as you. It asks you first only when a command looks destructive (deleting, moving, installing, changing permissions or git history), pipes a download into a shell, automates other apps or system settings, or overwrites an existing file. Anything else runs without asking, including commands that read your files, run scripts or send data over the network."
