     {
      "id": "download-exec",
      "label": "Would download and run Python and PDF tools the first time it extracts a figure; its developer can change what runs at any time",
      "concern": "medium",
      "detail": "Its developer can replace the file at any time without releasing a new version, and nothing checks it before it runs, so our check of the plugin doesn't cover what runs. The first time it extracts a figure, it would download a Python and Poppler bundle from the developer's GitHub release and run it, without asking; the README doesn't mention it. When we last checked, on 16 October 2026, that file didn't exist (the address returned 404), so nothing has been downloaded yet. We reviewed version 1.1.0; this release has the same code."
